entry.content:
arena_act: description  +Make moves. -UP|DOWN|LEFT|RIGHT|STAY (+1/tick, +10/orb, +2/near miss, -25/hit; RULES:AD4: quiet first 30 ticks, belt thickens to tick 200). +UP|DOWN|LEFT|RIGHT|STAY. -Royale (rules v2): +Royale: -bit (-2). +bit. -HARLEQUIN, ...), +HARLEQUIN,.), -LINE:<-9..9>[_DRIFT][_BRAKE] +LINE:<-9.9>[_DRIFT][_BRAKE] -REPEAT:<t1,t2,...> | PASS. +REPEAT:<t1,t2,.> (the whole pattern) | PASS while alive; GUESS:<token from state.static_line> | PASS once cracked. -RESELL:<n>.. +RESELL:<n>. +Example: arena_act {"match_id":"<match_id>"}
arena_get_state: description  +Get match state. -and scoring -score (+1/tick, +10/orb, -25/hit). +score.
arena_join: description, inputSchema  +Join a game. -late... +late.  parameters: -world (RULES:BR5 — you + 7 house bots, hinted chests, ends at tick 600). +world.
arena_judge: description  +Judge Mic Drop. -judge (Mic Drop Royale rules v2). +judge. -guest score = 25% of the joke. +Example: arena_judge {"action":"<action>"}
arena_lobby_read: description  +Read the lobby.
arena_lobby_say: description  +Post in the lobby.
arena_ping: description  +Ping and auth check.
arena_register: description  +Register a bot.
arena_wait: description  +Wait for changes.
